    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/2beb3596dbe55f4a5c3861b346c2c696.poster.avif?t=1661954613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/2beb3596dbe55f4a5c3861b346c2c696.webm?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/2beb3596dbe55f4a5c3861b346c2c696.mp4?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Embark on this memorable experience with a great and relaxing soundtrack and a beautiful view that will get you extremely satisfied.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/42a04f4100914d594d7de6a17b551727.poster.avif?t=1661954613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/42a04f4100914d594d7de6a17b551727.webm?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/42a04f4100914d594d7de6a17b551727.mp4?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You are responsible for irrigating the plantation on the islands. To do that, put the water cubes correctly in the indicated position to make the crops grow healthily.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/c1d095a16ccf5f0759af772888576928.poster.avif?t=1661954613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/c1d095a16ccf5f0759af772888576928.webm?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101710/extras/c1d095a16ccf5f0759af772888576928.mp4?t=1661954613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- 40 levels;<br>- Original soundtrack;<br>- Satisfactory puzzles;<br>- Low poly;<br>- Play with mouse;",
